    "name": "Sophos Central SIEM Alerts API",
    "description": "The Sophos Central SIEM API provides access to security alerts and events for automating threat detection, incident response, and SIEM integration workflows. Retrieve real-time alerts and events from Sophos Central to feed into your security operations tooling.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sophos Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-22T02:53:11.000Z",
